data: {"id": "8f79a516eea541db-thinking-parallel_evidence-1390", "run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据上游 handoff，需要调查 Pod `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` 的 CrashLoopBackOff 原因。\n\n**工具调用计划：**\n1.  `kubectl describe pod` 获取详细状态、Exit Code、Last State、Events。\n2.  `kubectl logs` 查看容器主进程退出前的日志，寻找崩溃原因。\n3.  `kubectl previous_logs` 查看上一次崩溃前的日志（如果可用）。\n4.  `query_pod_logs` 获取结构化日志，确认是否有错误堆栈。\n5.  `query_pod_promql` 检查内存/CPU 是否超限（OOMKill 常见原因）。\n6.  `query_pod_tracing` 检查是否有相关的异常请求记录。\n\n开始执行：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788470142219, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

