data: {"id": "8f79a516eea541db-thinking-parallel_evidence-2418", "run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好。我将根据 `tool_result` 中的事实进行诊断。\n\n**实体确认：**\n- Pod: `workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc`\n- Namespace: `aiops-case-10`\n\n**现状诊断：Pod 仍为 CrashLoopBackOff**\n\n- `kubectl get pod` 状态明确为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启 23 次，最后重启约 4 分钟前。\n- `kubectl describe pod` 显示容器最后退出的 Exit Code 为 **137**（被 SIGKILL 杀死），Reason 为 `CrashLoopBackOff`。\n- `kubectl describe pod` 和 `kubectl events` 显示 Liveness Probe 在 50m 前开始持续失败（HTTP 500），并触发了 17 次告警。\n- `kubectl events` 显示 `Back-off restarting failed container` 已发生 235 次，时间跨度 61 分钟。\n\n**Exit Code ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788470236315, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "8f79a516eea541db-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "seq": 2419, "ts_ms": 1788470242559, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 148.098, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-10", "name": "workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/8f79a516eea541db-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "61b7a2eceb54e272bf179e6eabc35bc868572fecc7f1129b055ed27d0da513f4", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "5d16f58049a5df03f711269030610ee14f580f7d9f49e21edc7d138a003fc45b"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "8f79a516eea541db-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "seq": 2420, "ts_ms": 1788470242560, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "8f79a516eea541db-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "seq": 2421, "ts_ms": 1788470252708, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 10.148, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1677, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod app容器配置的内存Limit（96Mi）过低，导致应用在处理请求时触发OOM Killer被系统强制终止（Exit Code 137）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Exit Code: 137 (fact-09cb4ee6fc85, fact-853d0d0d3d7d) | 直接证据，OOM Killer 终止进程的标准信号 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Memory Limit: 96Mi (fact-012f81acce81) | 根因，极低的硬限制约束了容器可用内存 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff / Liveness probe failed: statuscode: 500 (fact-3b6aac150905, fact-e22c21f7235b) | 现象验证，探针失败确认进程处于不可用状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Restart count: 23 (fact-6762180f9c4f) | 状态验证，高频重启对应 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: 1 (CrashLoopBackOff) (fact-642e6a15e584) | 聚合状态印证，当前处于等待重启状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: 1 (Error) (fact-e908d3984355) | 聚合状态印证，上一次终止原因为非零退出 |\n| 7 | Logging | Elasticsearch | request completed /work (HTTP 200) (fact-1c4e78a3af26, etc.) | 上下文：进程在崩溃前曾成功处理过请求 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes State 记录到 Exit Code 137 配合 Memory Limit 96Mi 构成了 OOM 的完整证据链；Metrics 确认了 CrashLoopBackOff 和 Error 状态；K8s Events 记录了由此引发的 Liveness Probe 失败；Logs 证明了应用并非初始启动即失败，而是具备处理能力但受限于资源被杀。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n内存 Limit (96Mi) 设置过低 → 处理请求时内存耗尽触发 OOM Killer → 进程强制终止 (Exit Code 137) → 容器重启循环 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **容器资源限制配置不当**。\n应用 Pod (`workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc`) 的 `app` 容器配置的内存硬限制（Memory Limit）仅为 `96Mi`。当应用处理请求时内存需求突破此限制，操作系统 OOM Killer 介入终止进程（证据 #1, #2）。这直接导致容器状态变更为 CrashLoopBackOff（证据 #4, #5, #6）及健康检查失败（证据 #3）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod app容器配置的内存Limit（96Mi）过低，导致应用在处理请求时触发OOM Killer被系统强制终止（Exit Code 137）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Exit Code: 137 (fact-09cb4ee6fc85, fact-853d0d0d3d7d) | 直接证据，OOM Killer 终止进程的标准信号 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Memory Limit: 96Mi (fact-012f81acce81) | 根因，极低的硬限制约束了容器可用内存 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff / Liveness probe failed: statuscode: 500 (fact-3b6aac150905, fact-e22c21f7235b) | 现象验证，探针失败确认进程处于不可用状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Restart count: 23 (fact-6762180f9c4f) | 状态验证，高频重启对应 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: 1 (CrashLoopBackOff) (fact-642e6a15e584) | 聚合状态印证，当前处于等待重启状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: 1 (Error) (fact-e908d3984355) | 聚合状态印证，上一次终止原因为非零退出 |\n| 7 | Logging | Elasticsearch | request completed /work (HTTP 200) (fact-1c4e78a3af26, etc.) | 上下文：进程在崩溃前曾成功处理过请求 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes State 记录到 Exit Code 137 配合 Memory Limit 96Mi 构成了 OOM 的完整证据链；Metrics 确认了 CrashLoopBackOff 和 Error 状态；K8s Events 记录了由此引发的 Liveness Probe 失败；Logs 证明了应用并非初始启动即失败，而是具备处理能力但受限于资源被杀。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n内存 Limit (96Mi) 设置过低 → 处理请求时内存耗尽触发 OOM Killer → 进程强制终止 (Exit Code 137) → 容器重启循环 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **容器资源限制配置不当**。\n应用 Pod (`workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc`) 的 `app` 容器配置的内存硬限制（Memory Limit）仅为 `96Mi`。当应用处理请求时内存需求突破此限制，操作系统 OOM Killer 介入终止进程（证据 #1, #2）。这直接导致容器状态变更为 CrashLoopBackOff（证据 #4, #5, #6）及健康检查失败（证据 #3）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "8f79a516eea541db-final", "run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "seq": 2423, "ts_ms": 1788470252724, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod app容器配置的内存Limit（96Mi）过低，导致应用在处理请求时触发OOM Killer被系统强制终止（Exit Code 137）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Exit Code: 137 (fact-09cb4ee6fc85, fact-853d0d0d3d7d) | 直接证据，OOM Killer 终止进程的标准信号 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Memory Limit: 96Mi (fact-012f81acce81) | 根因，极低的硬限制约束了容器可用内存 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | BackOff / Liveness probe failed: statuscode: 500 (fact-3b6aac150905, fact-e22c21f7235b) | 现象验证，探针失败确认进程处于不可用状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Restart count: 23 (fact-6762180f9c4f) | 状态验证，高频重启对应 CrashLoopBackOff |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason: 1 (CrashLoopBackOff) (fact-642e6a15e584) | 聚合状态印证，当前处于等待重启状态 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_last_terminated_reason: 1 (Error) (fact-e908d3984355) | 聚合状态印证，上一次终止原因为非零退出 |\n| 7 | Logging | Elasticsearch | request completed /work (HTTP 200) (fact-1c4e78a3af26, etc.) | 上下文：进程在崩溃前曾成功处理过请求 |\n\n**证据小结**：Kubernetes State 记录到 Exit Code 137 配合 Memory Limit 96Mi 构成了 OOM 的完整证据链；Metrics 确认了 CrashLoopBackOff 和 Error 状态；K8s Events 记录了由此引发的 Liveness Probe 失败；Logs 证明了应用并非初始启动即失败，而是具备处理能力但受限于资源被杀。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n内存 Limit (96Mi) 设置过低 → 处理请求时内存耗尽触发 OOM Killer → 进程强制终止 (Exit Code 137) → 容器重启循环 (CrashLoopBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **容器资源限制配置不当**。\n应用 Pod (`workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc`) 的 `app` 容器配置的内存硬限制（Memory Limit）仅为 `96Mi`。当应用处理请求时内存需求突破此限制，操作系统 OOM Killer 介入终止进程（证据 #1, #2）。这直接导致容器状态变更为 CrashLoopBackOff（证据 #4, #5, #6）及健康检查失败（证据 #3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 36.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 148.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 148.1s (Evidence 142.0s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 194.28, "metrics": {"run_id": "8f79a516eea541db", "mttr": {"value": "3.2m", "seconds": 194.28683352470398, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 194286.83352470398, "llm_calls": 13, "llm_duration_ms": 110076.70855522156, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 16, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 96758.36539268494, "tool_wall_durati